# Trivy ignore list.
#
# Entries here MUST carry a justification and an expiry date. An indefinite
# suppression is indistinguishable from an unnoticed vulnerability.
#
# Currently empty. This file previously suppressed three findings that came
# from pip's vendored dependency manifest (msgpack GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 and
# setuptools CVE-2025-47273 / CVE-2026-59890). The multi-stage build in #163
# removed pip from the runtime image entirely, so those findings no longer
# exist and the suppressions were deleted rather than left to expire.
#
# Trivy now reports zero fixable vulnerabilities against the runtime image
# with no suppressions at all. Keep it that way: prefer fixing the cause.
